# Probe 347/4c (lowering): `pack: (y: 6)` defines the Structure pack whose field is the Structure y with the content 6
# (Codex CODEX-OPUS-346-4C-Q57-REPLY), so `pack + 1` must be refused; exit 7 here measures the misreading of the group
# as the int expression 6.
fn: held () int
    pack: (y: 6)
    return: pack + 1
end: held
int: code 7
if: held() != 7
    code: 81
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
